OL,3,AJorja Smith, Chase & Status and Sam
OL,4,ASmith to head up Radio 1's Live Lounge
OL,5,Amonth
OL,6,
OL,7,FSam Smith, Chase & Status and Jorja
OL,8,FSmith are among the artists who have
OL,9,Fbeen revealed for BBC Radio 1's Live
OL,10,FLounge month.
OL,12,FIndie band Blossoms, singer-songwriter
OL,13,FRachel Chinouriri and US rappers
OL,14,FAnderson.Paak and Cordae will also take
OL,15,Fto the studio in October.
OL,17,FEach Live Lounge guest traditionally
OL,18,Fperforms an acoustic version of one of
OL,19,Ftheir own songs, plus a cover of a
OL,20,Ftrack by a different artist.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
